Listarr is based on retraktarr by zakary (GitHub user zakkarry):
https://github.com/zakkarry/retraktarr

The original project is licensed under the MIT License. Listarr retains the
original copyright and license notice and gives credit to the original author.

Listarr replaces retraktarr's Trakt destination with MDBList-specific list
synchronization while retaining and adapting the original Arr API concept,
filtering behavior, and command-line workflow.
